<title>
Fender Apron Panel, Fender Apron Extension and Front Strut Support Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
The figure below shows condition where the following parts are removed.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9A06005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Hood lock member and lamp support brace 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B06001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender lower bracket, front fender bracket and front fender rear bracket 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B06002"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Dash side front panel 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B06006"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILBA0A9B0010.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "100.820mm" ver = "01" gw = "372" gh = "269"/>
</figure>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06007001">
<title>
General Notes
</title>
<ptxt>
Welding method and number of welding points are the same on both sides. This repair instruction shows procedure for left side.
</ptxt>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06007002">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove fender apron panel, fender apron extension and front strut support.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Unscrew bolt and remove fender apron panel, fender apron extension and front strut support. (vehicle left side only)
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILBA0A9B0011.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "132.736mm" ver = "01" gw = "285" gh = "360"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
