<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[A]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Vehicle left side
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Vehicle right side
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove front strut support if necessary.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0113.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "69.659mm" ver = "01" gw = "225" gh = "181"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06007003">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<p-change/>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s).
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Front body: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Underbody: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04009"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Proceed repair while taking into consideration installation of parts that affect appearance. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install front strut support.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct plug weld or resistance spot weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0115.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "59.049mm" ver = "01" gw = "187" gh = "151"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install fender apron panel and fender apron extension.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct plug weld or resistance spot weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten bolt to specified torque. (vehicle left side only)
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILBA0A9B0012.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "123.882mm" ver = "01" gw = "316" gh = "335"/>
